  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/LRG1\r\n\r\nWith the vendors now having a change in circumstance this section needs to be SOLD so they can move onto their next opportunity!\r\n\r\nMature majestic bush, full of birdlife in a great location is one to explore. Here is your opportunity to purchase this large 2,034 sqm (approx.) site and take it from a blank canvas and turn it into something very special.\r\n\r\nAll the amenities are close by, with top golf courses, plenty of boat ramps, schools, medical centres, beautiful safe beaches and a selection of shops/cafes/restaurants along with 2 major supermarkets giving you plenty of reason to stay put. Something to look forward to in the next few years is the new Penlink exchange being approx. 2km away.\r\n\r\nMotivated vendors ensure a fair deal is on offer - give us a call, do the sums and be pleasantly surprised with the potential on offer here.\r\n\r\nNote: Photos are of an artist's impression. Boundary lines on photos are indicative only.",
